    <div>
      <p begin="00:17.820" end="00:19.740" ttm:agent="v1">Bad bitch and she from Chinatown</p>
      <p begin="00:19.740" end="00:21.900" ttm:agent="v1">Hop in the whip, skrrt off fast, dodgin' rounds</p>
      <p begin="00:21.900" end="00:23.540" ttm:agent="v1">Smokin' on gas and I be servin' all the pounds</p>
      <p begin="00:23.540" end="00:26.020" ttm:agent="v1">Catch me sippin' on Henny, another .40 goin' down</p>
      <p begin="00:26.020" end="00:28.370" ttm:agent="v1">Like strapped up, always got my chopstick</p>
      <p begin="00:28.370" end="00:30.010" ttm:agent="v1">Thots call me super, but I don't need a sidekick</p>
      <p begin="00:30.010" end="00:32.430" ttm:agent="v1">'Less that sidekicks yo bitch, shawty suckin' on my dick</p>
      <p begin="00:32.430" end="00:35.320" ttm:agent="v1">Got my finger on the trigger, you ain't even hear the click</p>
      <p begin="00:35.320" end="00:37.130" ttm:agent="v1">Bad bitch and she from Chinatown</p>
      <p begin="00:37.130" end="00:39.010" ttm:agent="v1">Hop in the whip, skrrt off fast, dodgin' rounds</p>
      <p begin="00:39.010" end="00:41.240" ttm:agent="v1">Smokin' on gas and I be servin' all the pounds</p>
