      <p begin="01:09.830" end="01:12.050" ttm:agent="v1">Just bagged a bitch, swear you know were she from</p>
      <p begin="01:12.050" end="01:14.180" ttm:agent="v1">Chinatown, said that once, you bitches dumb?</p>
