      <p begin="01:18.780" end="01:20.640" ttm:agent="v1">Pulling pedals, she saying did he love me or not?</p>
      <p begin="01:20.640" end="01:22.840" ttm:agent="v1">Dumbass bitch, I ain't tripping over any thot</p>
